{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 1, "text": "안녕하세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 2, "text": "드디어 왔네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 3, "text": "여기서 나가고 싶으신가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 4, "text": "그럼 열쇠 좀 찾아주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 5, "text": "// Key Search"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 6, "text": "이런, 여기 없잖아요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 7, "text": "비어 있어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 8, "text": "아무것도 없다니까요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 9, "text": "찾았어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 11, "text": "// The usual conversation"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 12, "text": "더 작을 줄 알았는데!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 13, "text": "이렇게 크다니!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 14, "text": "언니랑 똑같아요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 16, "text": "언니?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 18, "text": "네, 언니요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 19, "text": "설마 못 만난 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 21, "text": "우리 완전 친해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 23, "text": "혹시… 바보예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 25, "text": "윽…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 27, "text": "바보 맞네…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 28, "text": "됐고, 어서 열쇠나 찾아주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 30, "text": "// Next work"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 31, "text": "자!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 32, "text": "이 쇳조각들을 파이프에 넣어주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 33, "text": "고마워요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 34, "text": "이제 장작 좀 내려주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 35, "text": "고마워요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 36, "text": "여기 좀 도와주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 37, "text": "완성이에요! 보세요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 38, "text": "너무 예쁘지 않나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 39, "text": "자, 눌러보세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 40, "text": "준비하시고!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 41, "text": "됐어요, 받으세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 42, "text": "이 열쇠는 이제 당신 거예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 49, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Quest 1 (Are you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 53, "text": "전 미니 미타.fbx예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 54, "text": "대사도 엄청 많아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 55, "text": "모델링은 심플하지만,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 56, "text": "예쁜 머리카락을 가졌죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 2 (Have we seen each other yet?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 59, "text": "뭐야, 바보 같아!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 60, "text": "그래도 엉뚱한 질문을 하는 모습이"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 61, "text": "너무 귀여워요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 62, "text": "생각해 보니,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 63, "text": "저랑은 처음 만났네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 64, "text": "하지만…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 65, "text": "누군가 저의 완벽한 외모를 훔쳤다면,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 66, "text": "가만두지 않을 거예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Quest 3 (Why are you here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 69, "text": "아직도 모르시겠어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 70, "text": "여긴 체크포인트예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 71, "text": "플레이어님의 지능을 체크할 수 있죠!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 72, "text": "얼른 따라와요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 73, "text": "길 잃은 바보는 제가 안내해 줄게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why are you helping me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 76, "text": "플레이어님은 특별하니까,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 77, "text": "안 도와드릴 이유가 없죠!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 79, "text": "뭐라고?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 81, "text": "바보!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 82, "text": "어디서 왔는지도 모르면서!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 83, "text": "지금 여기 있으면 안 돼요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 84, "text": "그래서 도와드리는 거죠!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 86, "text": "잘 가요, 바보!"}
